      "content": "thanks for the heads up on the 999 patent. that's a bit concerning, but i feel like our co-design aspect is pretty distinct from just a generic mesh. \n\nto be honest, the board is breathing down my neck to get this moving. they're looking to greenlight a massive series A based on our IP strength, so we really need a high confidence level here. do you think we can actually differentiate ourselves enough to make this a strong patent, or is 11,000,999 going to be a total dealbreaker for the examiners? basically, are we looking at a 'maybe' or a 'not gonna happen'?",
